@startuml
!theme plain
title Login policy resolution (rc.7 contract)
start
:Resolve authentication source;
note right
  Home/native or explicitly admitted external source.
  Protected setup-token delivery remains planned.
end note
:Resolve machine credential_store selector;
note right
  native (default), file, keychain.
  Managed Muse native maps to file (CIP-0017).
end note
if (Supported source/store mapping?) then (yes)
  :Check isolation admission;
  if (Isolation and native source compatible?) then (yes)
    :Select link strategy;
    :Project home paths and backend policy;
    :Launcher applies policy at login and launch;
  else (no)
    :Refuse; no credential migration;
  endif
else (no)
  :Refuse; no fallback to native;
endif
stop
@enduml
